      "subject": "Subject: each image shows exactly one of these 6 things, each thing about equally often: (1) a tall pointed heater shield, crimson red with a bold gold chevron; (2) a tall pointed heater shield split down the middle, left half crimson red and right half royal blue, with a gold rim; (3) a crimson red swallow-tailed banner flying from a wooden pole with a gold spear tip; (4) a tall pointed heater shield, crimson red with a gold castle tower on it; (5) a tall pointed heater shield, royal blue with a gold crown on it; (6) a crimson red heater shield with a steel sword behind it, the hilt above and the point below."
